# Lab 04 – Exploratory Data Analysis

## Overview
This lab focused on exploratory data analysis, also known as EDA. The goal was to understand a dataset before building a model.

## What I Learned
- How to inspect a dataset
- How to check columns, missing values, and data types
- How to use charts and summary statistics to find patterns

## Tools Used
- Python
- pandas
- matplotlib
- seaborn

## Reflection
This lab showed me that understanding the data is an important step before training any machine learning model.
